<p>Reality bends slightly in the presence of a Shaloren due to their inherent magical nature.</p><p>Increases critical chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10%</acronym> and critical strike power by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 9%, 13%, 16%, 20%.</acronym></p>